@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082
@customerA = demo-customer-a
@customerB = demo-customer-b
@merchantA = demo-merchant-a
@merchantB = demo-merchant-b

### 准备：应用建表后执行 scripts/order-query-demo.sql，两个端访问同一批销售订单。
### 用户甲：本人销售订单 501、502、504，total=3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consumer/orders/page
Authorization: Bearer {{customerA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"pageNumber":1,"pageSize":20}

### 用户甲按商家甲筛选：501、504，total=2；不返回用户乙的 503
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consumer/orders/page
Authorization: Bearer {{customerA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"merchantId":1001,"pageNumber":1,"pageSize":20}

### 用户甲按商家乙筛选：502，total=1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consumer/orders/page
Authorization: Bearer {{customerA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"merchantId":2001}

### 商家甲：本商家销售订单 501、503、504，total=3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/merchant/orders/page
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"pageNumber":1,"pageSize":20}

### 商家甲按用户甲筛选：501、504，total=2；不返回商家乙的 502
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/merchant/orders/page
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId":301}

### 用户乙：503、505，total=2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consumer/orders/page
Authorization: Bearer {{customerB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 商家乙：502、505，total=2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/merchant/orders/page
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 用户甲第二页：502，total仍为3；固定按销售订单 ID 升序
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consumer/orders/page
Authorization: Bearer {{customerA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"pageNumber":2,"pageSize":1}

### 用户令牌不能进入商家端：403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/merchant/orders/page
Authorization: Bearer {{customerA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 商家令牌不能进入用户端：403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consumer/orders/page
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 用户甲伪造 customerId 和入口 Header：400 VALIDATION_ERROR，未知归属字段拒绝
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consumer/orders/page
Authorization: Bearer {{customerA}}
X-Customer-Id: 302
X-Access-Entry: merchant
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId":302}

### 用户甲仅伪造入口 Header：仍仅本人 501、502、504，total=3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consumer/orders/page
Authorization: Bearer {{customerA}}
X-Customer-Id: 302
X-Access-Entry: merchant
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 通用销售订单分页禁用：404 ENTITY_NOT_EXPOSED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/merchantOrder/page
Content-Type: application/json

{}
